  "configuration_id": "config_039",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that transformer aggregation and weighted fusion (config_033) achieve high performance with scvi_n200 RNA and resnet50 image encoders. This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l image encoder while keeping scvi_n200 RNA, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion. It isolates the impact of the image encoder choice, a critical design decision with no direct comparison in prior experiments. This clarifies whether the more complex imagenet_vit_l encoder improves performance in the optimal setup, balancing exploration of key components with exploitation of proven strategies."
}

